## Phase 5: Review --> Deploy

**Required artifacts**: Self-review completed, all checks passing

### Checklist

| # | Requirement | How to verify |
|---|------------|---------------|
| 1 | Self-review passed | `/self-review` was run and returned READY |
| 2 | Security audit passed | No CRITICAL or HIGH findings from security review |
| 3 | Performance checked | No N+1 queries, no missing indexes, no unbounded queries |
| 4 | CI pipeline passes | Run: `gh run list --branch $(git branch --show-current) --limit 1 --json conclusion` |
{{#ifHasStack config "next-ssr"}}
| 5 | Design review passed | UI components follow design system, accessibility checks pass |
{{/ifHasStack}}
{{#ifHasStack config "vite-spa"}}
| 5 | Design review passed | UI components follow design system, accessibility checks pass |
{{/ifHasStack}}
| 6 | No open blockers | No unresolved BLOCKER-level findings |
| 7 | Branch is up to date | Branch is rebased on latest main with no conflicts |
| 8 | PR description is complete | PR has summary, test plan, and screenshots (if UI) |

